<title>JAPAN: GM to make Mitsubishi car in India - paper.</title>
<headline>GM to make Mitsubishi car in India - paper.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors Corp will produce a Mitsubishi Motors Corp passenger car at GM's Indian unit in early 1998, in the first alliance of the two companies, Japanese economic daily Nihon Keizai Shimbun said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors officials were not immediately available for comment on the report, which said the model to be produced would be a small passenger car.  </p>
<p>GM's unit will produce about 10,000 of the 1,500cc Lancers per year, the paper said.</p>
</text>
